# The scroll scene's sideways strip under KAYA_LOCALE=ar-EG
# (docs/hscroll-plan.md §4): the strip starts at its right edge and ends at
# its left. Before a backend reads the layout's direction, its start already
# satisfies the right-edge-at-right-edge reading of "at end", so both verbs
# agree wrongly; expect_at_start is the read that tells them apart.
expect_overflow scroll@strip
expect_at_start scroll@strip
scroll_end scroll@strip
expect_at_end scroll@strip
click button@last
expect label#0 "last card clicked"
